        {
            "id": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/nana-to-kaoru-nana-chigusa-16-native.html",
            "url": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/nana-to-kaoru-nana-chigusa-16-native.html",
            "title": "Nana to Kaoru - Nana Chigusa 1/6 (Native)",
            "summary": "Do you like S&amp;M? Do you like romcoms? This is the main character of the manga (OVA and live-action movie)&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Do you like S&amp;M? Do you like romcoms? This is the main character of the manga (OVA and live-action movie) Nana to Kaoru, by Ryuta Amazume, a comedic romance revolving around the <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-7\" data-original-text=\"relation\" data-corrected-text=\"relationship\" data-pos=\"187\" data-len=\"12\">relationship</span> of Kaoru Sugimura, a 17-year-old virgin with <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-10\" data-original-text=\"a\" data-corrected-text=\"an\" data-pos=\"246\" data-len=\"2\">an</span> S&amp;M <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-13\" data-original-text=\"fetich\" data-corrected-text=\"fetish,\" data-pos=\"259\" data-len=\"7\">fetish,</span> and Nana Chigusa, her childhood friend and neighbor.</div>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><br>This <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-20\" data-original-text=\"astoniching\" data-corrected-text=\"astonishing\" data-pos=\"349\" data-len=\"11\">astonishing</span> figure made by Native was released in 2011, and it has <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-23\" data-original-text=\"2\" data-corrected-text=\"two\" data-pos=\"417\" data-len=\"3\">two</span> versions, one in black (the one I have) and one in red. The <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-26\" data-original-text=\"2\" data-corrected-text=\"two\" data-pos=\"482\" data-len=\"3\">two</span> versions retailed for <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-29\" data-original-text=\"9000\" data-corrected-text=\"9,000\" data-pos=\"512\" data-len=\"5\">9,000</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-32\" data-original-text=\"Yen\" data-corrected-text=\"yen\" data-pos=\"521\" data-len=\"3\">yen</span> and were sold <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-37\" data-original-text=\"as\" data-corrected-text=\"in\" data-pos=\"541\" data-len=\"2\">in</span> limited <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-40\" data-original-text=\"in number\" data-corrected-text=\"quantities\" data-pos=\"561\" data-len=\"10\">quantities</span>.</div>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><br>To me<span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-46\" data-original-text=\"&lt;br&gt;\" data-corrected-text=\",\" data-pos=\"591\" data-len=\"1\">,</span> it is one of the most <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-51\" data-original-text=\"beutyfull\" data-corrected-text=\"beautiful\" data-pos=\"624\" data-len=\"9\">beautiful</span> figures I have, very accurate to the manga, with great sculpting, vibrant <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-56\" data-original-text=\"colours\" data-corrected-text=\"colors,\" data-pos=\"715\" data-len=\"7\">colors,</span> and fantastic paint.</div>",
            "image": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/5/images-1.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "XIco"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "Nana to Kaoru",
                   "Figures"
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-07-15T20:22:53+01:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-15T21:39:46+01:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/slam-dunk-sakuragi-hanamichi.html",
            "url": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/slam-dunk-sakuragi-hanamichi.html",
            "title": "Slam Dunk - Sakuragi Hanamichi",
            "summary": "This is one of my favorite cels, Sakuragi Hanamichi from Slam Dunk. This adaptation of the manga by Takehiko Inoue&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>This is one of my favorite cels, Sakuragi Hanamichi from Slam Dunk.</p>\n<p>This adaptation of the manga by Takehiko Inoue (creator of Vagabond and Real) is in my top animes/mangas, Sports, drama and a lot of humor make this series a fun one to watch. The only catch is that the action (the basketball games) is a little slow, with the typical repetitions and plays going on and on, but the animation is not bad for a 90s show.</p>\n<p>The main character, Sakuragi Hanamichi, is lightly based on the NBA player Dennis Rodman, and as a newbie in the game. with 0 experience, and a great deal of self-esteem, thinks of herself as the \"genius of basketball\" and with great effort and hard work gain a place on the team.</p>\n<figure class=\"post__image\"><img loading=\"lazy\"  src=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/4/5gzyzau38uch1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" sizes=\"(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/4/responsive/5gzyzau38uch1-xs.jpeg 300w ,https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/4/responsive/5gzyzau38uch1-sm.jpeg 480w ,https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/4/responsive/5gzyzau38uch1-md.jpeg 768w\"></figure>",
            "image": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/4/images-5.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "XIco"
            },
            "tags": [
                   "Takehiko Inoue",
                   "Slam Dunk",
                   "Animation cels"
            ],
            "date_published": "2026-07-15T19:00:04+01:00",
            "date_modified": "2026-07-15T22:09:08+01:00"
        },
        {
            "id": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/colorful-dvd-us.html",
            "url": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/colorful-dvd-us.html",
            "title": "Colorful! - DVD - US",
            "summary": "This is a fun one. I don't remember why and where I got this DVD, probably I got it from&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">This is a fun one. I <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-5\" data-original-text=\"dont\" data-corrected-text=\"don't\" data-pos=\"26\" data-len=\"5\">don't</span> remember why and where I got this DVD, p<span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-11\" data-original-text=\"problably\" data-corrected-text=\"Probably\" data-pos=\"81\" data-len=\"8\">robably</span> I got it from the Archonia webstore in the mid <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-14\" data-original-text=\"2000\" data-corrected-text=\"2000s\" data-pos=\"141\" data-len=\"5\">2000s</span>, and boy, what an anime.</div>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><br>This is a collection of short<span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-20\" data-original-text=\"&lt;br&gt;\" data-corrected-text=\",\" data-pos=\"214\" data-len=\"1\">,</span> bizarre stories (16 episodes of 7 minutes) of some boys and men trying to see some panties. The animation is a mix of over-the-top expressions and realistic <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-29\" data-original-text=\"imaginery\" data-corrected-text=\"imagery\" data-pos=\"384\" data-len=\"7\">imagery</span>, <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-32\" data-original-text=\"wirh\" data-corrected-text=\"with\" data-pos=\"397\" data-len=\"4\">with</span> some weird angles and <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-35\" data-original-text=\"colours\" data-corrected-text=\"colors\" data-pos=\"431\" data-len=\"6\">colors</span> .</div>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><br>The edition is from ADV<span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-42\" data-original-text=\".\" data-corrected-text=\",\" data-pos=\"476\" data-len=\"1\">,</span> region 1 (USA), 110 <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-47\" data-original-text=\"minues\" data-corrected-text=\"minutes\" data-pos=\"504\" data-len=\"7\">minutes</span>  and <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-50\" data-original-text=\"have\" data-corrected-text=\"has\" data-pos=\"521\" data-len=\"3\">has</span> <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-53\" data-original-text=\"japanesse\" data-corrected-text=\"Japanese\" data-pos=\"534\" data-len=\"8\">Japanese</span> audio with subtitles and <span class=\"highlight added\" data-tooltip-id=\"tooltip-56\" data-original-text=\"english\" data-corrected-text=\"English\" data-pos=\"575\" data-len=\"7\">English</span> dub.</div>\n<div data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/3/gallery/shared-image-3.jpg\" data-size=\"1530x2040\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/3/gallery/shared-image-3-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/3/gallery/shared-image-4-2.jpg\" data-size=\"1530x2040\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/3/gallery/shared-image-4-2-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n</div>",
            "image": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/3/images-2.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "XIco"
            },
