        {
            "id": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/ranma-12-pt-1996.html",
            "url": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/ranma-12-pt-1996.html",
            "title": "Ranma 1/2 - PT (1996)",
            "summary": "With this first post about manga, and I want to start with the first manga I bought, Ranma 1/2. This&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<p>With this first post about manga, and I want to start with the first manga I bought, Ranma 1/2. This year mark 30 years since that time, in September of 1997 when it came to the stands in Portugal, the first number of a +/- 32 pages edition of this title by Rumiko Takahashi.</p>\n<p>It was a comic format edition in size, with the pages inverted to occidental reading, and it was short lived, with only 12 numbers published.</p>\n<p>I already knew the title as the anime was aired in Spain in 1993 while I lived there, and it was my go to watch before I went to high school. The humor, fighting and \"romance\" made me a fan of this title, and later of other works by Rumiko Takahashi.</p>\n<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/2/gallery/shared-image-6.jpg\" data-size=\"1530x2040\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/2/gallery/shared-image-6-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/2/gallery/shared-image-2.jpg\" data-size=\"1530x2040\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/2/gallery/shared-image-2-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/2/gallery/shared-image-5.jpg\" data-size=\"1530x2040\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/2/gallery/shared-image-5-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/2/gallery/shared-image-1.jpg\" data-size=\"1530x2040\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/2/gallery/shared-image-1-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1024\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>",
            "image": "https://xicoesp.github.io/gh-pages/media/posts/2/images-4.jpg",
            "author": {
                "name": "XIco"
            },
